    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>1. Different Ways to Breed Elite Horses</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3503710/extras/a52d538bee2ac9248245267ab1891aad.avif?t=1754276020\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can breed horses that focus on specific abilities. For example, to have a better draft horse, you can breed a baby horse from a stallion with a high stamina attribute and formulate a specific feed to increase its strength ability.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>2. Buy and Sell Horses</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3503710/extras/f4a891a626aaf89de184f8fc01773a24.avif?t=1754276020\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buy horses and start your business. Breed better and better horses, forge equipment for them, and then sell them for a good price. With a well-equipped and capable horse, you can make a lot of money.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>3. Forge Equipment and Weapons</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3503710/extras/9df19708b6849db722fed9a021c9549a.avif?t=1754276020\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Improve your skills and upgrade your smithy, forging different equipment and weapons to sell or use on your horse.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>4. The store</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3503710/extras/8559189fe2636eda895e7dff6c1b9280.avif?t=1754276020\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sell \u200b\u200bthe equipment and weapons you forge in your store to attract more customers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>1. Different Ways to Breed Elite Horses</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3503710/extras/a52d538bee2ac9248245267ab1891aad.avif?t=1754276020\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can breed horses that focus on specific abilities. For example, to have a better draft horse, you can breed a baby horse from a stallion with a high stamina attribute and formulate a specific feed to increase its strength ability.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>2. Buy and Sell Horses</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3503710/extras/f4a891a626aaf89de184f8fc01773a24.avif?t=1754276020\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buy horses and start your business. Breed better and better horses, forge equipment for them, and then sell them for a good price. With a well-equipped and capable horse, you can make a lot of money.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>3. Forge Equipment and Weapons</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3503710/extras/9df19708b6849db722fed9a021c9549a.avif?t=1754276020\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Improve your skills and upgrade your smithy, forging different equipment and weapons to sell or use on your horse.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>4. The store</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3503710/extras/8559189fe2636eda895e7dff6c1b9280.avif?t=1754276020\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sell \u200b\u200bthe equipment and weapons you forge in your store to attract more customers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p>",
